            "text": "VOL \u2192 TOP Rendering Pipeline\n\nRaymarchVOL converts a 3D volume into a 2D image (TOP).\nThis is the primary rendering path for volumetric data.\n\nHigh-quality settings:\n  - 200 steps at 0.006 step size for smooth results\n  - High density_scale + absorption for rich contrast\n  - BlurVOL softens before rendering\n\nThe NullTOP holds the 2D texture for further compositing\n(e.g. CompositeTOP, LevelTOP, FeedbackTOP).",
